{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PECADO is a first-person folkloric horror experience set in the \u201cEspa\u00f1a profunda\u201d. Listen to the word of God. Experience atmospheric horror and immerse yourself in the events of this gruesome story set in the 1990s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Espa\u00f1a profunda&quot; An environment inspired by rural and decaying Spain, where religion, violence, and silence rule everyday life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide. Use stealth and avoid the gaze of those who stalk you. Hide from entities whose very presence can break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the story through a fragmented narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pray. Do not lose faith; losing it is the end of the road. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to keep your path in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. Interact with the environment and use objects in your inventory to make your way and protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Run</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104520?t=1774907117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104520/84f2abb2e85e7c5aa0f13b34c8e8195b9b46f56a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774907117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104520/dd1bf3dfbf999e2d1f7655dc379c7bd7b9bc9dfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774907117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104520/dd1bf3dfbf999e2d1f7655dc379c7bd7b9bc9dfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774907117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PECADO is a first-person folkloric horror experience set in the \u201cEspa\u00f1a profunda\u201d. Listen to the word of God. Experience atmospheric horror and immerse yourself in the events of this gruesome story set in the 1990s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Espa\u00f1a profunda&quot; An environment inspired by rural and decaying Spain, where religion, violence, and silence rule everyday life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide. Use stealth and avoid the gaze of those who stalk you. Hide from entities whose very presence can break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the story through a fragmented narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pray. Do not lose faith; losing it is the end of the road. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to keep your path in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. Interact with the environment and use objects in your inventory to make your way and protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Run</p>","developers":["Solid Neon SD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104520/0565f37c6d9b372f83bd6f36dede1337cd3fc9da/header.jpg?t=1774907117","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104520/1914193993/f9eb42876c26946f845d79da711780db80fc6b11/1761125498/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762116400","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104520/1914193993/f9eb42876c26946f845d79da711780db80fc6b11/1761125498/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762116400","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104520/1914193993/f9eb42876c26946f845d79da711780db80fc6b11/1761125498/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762116400","id":257220952,"name":"PECADO trailer","thumbn